flow-hidden bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground [a&amp;]:hover:bg-secondary/90 font-mono">1 × processed pages</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="mt-10 mb-4 text-center"><p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-3">// Extra features</p><h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl text-foreground font-semibold tracking-tight">Optional fetch settings</h3></div><div class="grid gap-4 md:hidden"><div data-slot="card" class="text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-lg border py-6 bg-background"><div data-slot="card-content" class="space-y-4 px-5 py-5"><div class="space-y-1"><h4 class="font-mono text-sm text-foreground">Render mode: auto / fast / js</h4><p class="font-mono text-xs text-foreground/50">Changes the fetch strategy. Render mode does not change the credit cost.</p></div><div class="space-y-1"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground">Credit Modifier</p><p class="font-mono text-sm text-foreground">+0</p></div></div></div><div data-slot="card" class="text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-lg border py-6 bg-background"><div data-slot="card-content" class="space-y-4 px-5 py-5"><div class="space-y-1"><h4 class="font-mono text-sm text-foreground">Stealth toggle</h4><p class="font-mono text-xs text-foreground/50">Adds anti-bot bypass on top of the selected render mode.</p></div><div class="space-y-1"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground">Credit Modifier</p><p class="font-mono text-sm text-foreground">+5</p></div></div></div></div><div class="hidden overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border md:block"><table class="w-full"><thead><tr class="border-b bg-muted/50"><th class="px-6 py-3 text-left font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground">Fetch Setting</th><th class="px-6 py-3 text-center font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground">Credit Modifier</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-border"><tr><td class="px-6 py-3"><span class="font-mono text-sm text-foreground">Render mode: auto / fast / js</span><p class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-foreground/50">Changes the fetch strategy. Render mode does not change the credit cost.</p></td><td class="px-6 py-3 text-center font-mono text-sm text-foreground align-top">+0</td></tr><tr><td class="px-6 py-3"><span class="font-mono text-sm text-foreground">Stealth toggle</span><p class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-foreground/50">Adds anti-bot bypass on top of the selected render mode.</p></td><td class="px-6 py-3 text-center font-mono text-sm text-foreground align-top">+5</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="mx-auto mt-14 max-w-5xl rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/20 p-4 text-center"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-foreground/70">Need a focused estimator?<!-- --> <a class="text-foreground underline underline-offset-4" href="/price-calculator">Open the standalone price calculator</a>.</p></div><div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-5xl"><div class="mb-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center"><p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-6">// Estimate your costs</p><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-foreground font-semibold tracking-tight">Credit Calculator</h3></div><div class="border border-border rounded-lg overflow-hidden"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-border sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5"><button type="button" class="min-w-0 border-b-2 px-4 py-3 text-center transition-colors border-primary text-foreground"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest">Scrape</span></button><button type="button" class="min-w-0 border-b-2 px-4 py-3 text-center transition-colors border-transparent text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest">Extract</span></button><button type="button" class="min-w-0 border-b-2 px-4 py-3 text-center transition-colors border-transparent text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest">Search</span></button><button type="button" class="min-w-0 border-b-2 px-4 py-3 text-center transition-colors border-transparent text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest">Crawl</span></button><button type="button" class="min-w-0 border-b-2 px-4 py-3 text-center transition-colors border-transparent text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest">Monitor</span></button></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] divide-y lg:divide-y-0 lg:divide-x divide-border"><div class="p-6 space-y-5"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-foreground/50">URL to markdown, HTML, screenshot</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="space-y-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground">Input</span><select aria-label="Input type" class="border-input focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 h-9 w-full rounded-md border bg-transparent px-3 py-2 text-sm outline-none transition-[color,box-shadow] focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50"><option value="webpage" selected="">Webpage</option><option value="pdf">PDF</option></select></div><div class="space-y-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground">Render Mode</span><select aria-label="Render Mode" class="border-input focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 h-9 w-full rounded-md border bg-transparent px-3 py-2 text-sm outline-none transition-[color,box-shadow] focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50"><option value="auto" selected="">Auto</option><option value="fast">Fast</option><option value="js">JS</option></select></div><div class="space-y-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground">Stealth</span><div class="flex h-9 items-center justify-between rounded-md border border-input px-3"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-foreground/70">+<!-- -->5<!-- --> credits</span><button type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="false" data-state="unchecked" value="on" data-slot="switch" class="peer group relative inline-flex h-[18px] w-9 shrink-0 items-center rounded bg-foreground/10 transition-colors duration-200 outline-none focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 data-[state=checked]:bg-primary"><span data-state="unchecked" data-slot="switch-thumb" class="pointer-events-none absolute size-3 rounded-[2px] bg-muted-foreground ring-0 transition-[left] duration-200 ease-in-out left-[3px] data-[state=checked]:left-[calc(100%-15px)] data-[state=checked]:bg-primary-foreground"></span></button><input type="checkbox" aria-hidden="true" style="transform:translateX(-100%);position:absolute;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;margin:0" tabindex="-1" value="on"/></div></div><div class="space-y-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground">Format</span><select aria-label="Format" class="border-input focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 h-9 w-full rounded-md border bg-transparent px-3 py-2 text-sm outline-none transition-[color,box-shadow] focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50"><option value="markdown" selected="">markdown</option><option value="html">html</option><option value="links">links</option><option value="images">images</option><option value="summary">summary</option><option value="json">json</option><option value="branding">branding</option><option value="screenshot">screenshot</option></select></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 lg:w-56"><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-2">Per Request</span><span class="font-mono text-5xl font-medium text-foreground">1</span><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mt-1">Credits</span><p class="mt-4 max-w-48 text-center font-mono text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Auto mode selected. We use the cheapest approach first; this<!-- --> <!-- -->request<!-- --> could be as high as<!-- --> <span class="text-foreground">6</span> credits<!-- -->.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><section id="feature-comparison" class="max-w-[1536px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 py-16 sm:py-20"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center mb-10"><p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-6">// How we compare</p><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-foreground text-balance font-semibold tracking-tight">Features Comparison</h2></div><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto bg-background border overflow-hidden"><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full"><thead class="bg-muted/50"><tr><th class="text-left p-4 font-medium text-foreground align-middle">Feature</th><th class="text-center p-4 align-middle"><span data-slot="badge" data-variant="default" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-transparent text-xs font-medium w-fit whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3 gap-1 [&amp;&gt;svg]:pointer-events-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive transition-[color,box-shadow] overflow-hidden [a&amp;]:hover:bg-primary/90 bg-primary/10 text-primary px-3 py-1">ScrapeGraphAI</span></th><th class="text-center p-4 font-medium text-foreground align-middle">Scrapy</th><th class="text-center p-4 font-medium text-foreground align-middle">BeautifulSoup</th><th class="text-center p-4 font-medium text-foreground align-middle">Selenium</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b hover:bg-muted/30 transition-colors"><td class="p-4 font-medium text-foreground align-middle">AI-Powered Extraction</td><td class="p-4 text-center align-middle"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-5 h-5 text-primary mx-auto" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></td><td class="p-4 text-center align-middle"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x w-5 h-5 text-muted-foreground/50 mx-auto" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></td><td class="p-4 text-center align-middle"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x w-5 h-5 text-muted-foreground/50 mx-auto" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></td><td class="p-4 text-center align-middle"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x w-5 h-5 text-muted-foreground/50 mx-auto" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></td></tr><tr class="border-b hover:bg-muted/30 transition-colors"><td class="p-4 font-medium text-foreground align-middle">Zero Maintenance</td><td class="p-4 text-center align-middle"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=